  "body": "## What changed\n\nThe V-Carve table now gives the Stepdown default as 5.\n`section_lead` skips only a complete leading block in the catalog generator's format.\nMalformed blocks remain visible to the icon check.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe guide named a document setting that does not exist.\n`Carried.stepdown` defaults to 5 in `crates/app/src/operation/kinds.rs`.\nThe helper searched the whole section for an end marker.\nIt could consume section text and the end marker of a later block.\n\n## Tests\n\nBase: upstream/main `4e7929dfe`. Final head: `ff3ba1497`.\n\n- `python3 -m unittest discover -s site/tests -p test_guide_icons.py -k section_lead -v`: 3 pass.\n- The same command with `-k vcarve_stepdown`: 1 passes.\n- The same command with `-k operation_sections`: 1 passes.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: green. 0 steps, 0 failures, 0 stalls.\n- `git diff --check`: passes.\n\nThese pins failed before the fix:\n\n- `test_vcarve_stepdown_default_is_five`\n- `test_section_lead_preserves_catalog_with_intervening_section_text`\n- `test_section_lead_preserves_unclosed_catalog_before_later_block`\n\nMutation: copied the upstream guide back. The default pin failed. Restored the fix. The pin passed.\nMutation: copied the upstream helper back while keeping the pins. Both malformed-block pins failed.\nRestored the fix. Both pins passed.\n`test_section_lead_skips_only_a_valid_leading_catalog` passed throughout.\n\nThe existing `test_component_static_icons_and_license_match_app` fails on this head and the unchanged upstream test.\nThe site lacks `op-multiaxis-deburr.png` and `op-waterjet-profile.png` on both versions.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\n`git diff --stat upstream/main -- '*.nc' '*.cl'` gives no output.\nNo recorded program changed. The app catalog and golden suites were not run.\nThe change touches only the site guide and its Python tests. The light-box scope excludes unrelated Rust suites.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nZola rendering: `zola` is unavailable.\nClippy: no Rust crate changed.\nHeavy lanes: no motion, simulation, post, geometry, or app operation changed.\nNo UI code changed, so before/after screenshots do not apply.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nPR #3103 touches the same file, different function; whichever merges second refreshes.\nIt changes the Bore section. This change corrects the V-Carve table.\n\nEffort: low\n\nChangelog: Correct the V-Carve Stepdown default in the guide.\n\nFixes #3275\n",
